            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:20:52 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1909</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.9</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> every action point from a meeting could pile onto one
      task, each renaming it in turn. Each point you own now becomes its own
      task, and one that matches a task Jarvis already found in Slack just
      adds the meeting to that task's sources.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
