        <item>
            <title>0.19.8</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:58:49 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1908</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.8</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Fixed:</b> when a meeting's action points were matched to a task
      Jarvis had already found in Slack, the task could be renamed after a
      different point from the meeting. A meeting now only adds itself to a
      task's sources — it never changes the task's name or description.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
